  "content": "<p>Update on <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/Plushtodon\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Plushtodon</span></a> pre-orders: The plushies are going through German customs on the way to our warehouse, after which they’ll start getting shipped out. Unfortunately we could not meet the early November deadline that we promised due to delays outside our control. You will get an email once your order is dispatched. You can still pre-order if you haven’t yet!</p><p><a href=\"https://shop.joinmastodon.org/products/pre-order-mastodon-plushie-20cm-plushtodon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">shop.joinmastodon.org/products</span><span class=\"invisible\">/pre-order-mastodon-plushie-20cm-plushtodon</span></a></p>",
